usage_full_en() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Concepts:
  prefix   Compatibility data directory (Wine pfx at prefix/pfx)
  runner   Proton or Wine runtime for Windows executables

Run:
  shorin-proton-wrapper app.exe [args...]
  shorin-proton-wrapper -p ~/Games/game-prefix app.exe
  shorin-proton-wrapper --runner /path/to/proton app.exe

Prefix tools:
  shorin-proton-wrapper --init [-p DIR] [--runner PATH]
  shorin-proton-wrapper --winecfg [-p DIR] [--runner PATH]
  shorin-proton-wrapper --status [-p DIR] [--runner PATH]
  shorin-proton-wrapper --netns on|off [-p DIR]

Sessions:
  Programs running in the same prefix share one Wine session. A program
  started while the prefix is busy joins it at once and keeps the session's
  runner, display (X11, Wayland or Gamescope) and network. With --netns on
  the session gets its own network namespace, so the TUN adapter a game
  accelerator creates there carries the programs of that prefix only.
  A Linux program (a command, not a Windows program) given instead of an
  exe runs in that namespace as the user, e.g. "shorin-proton-wrapper steam";
  with --netns off it just runs.

Runner discovery:
  shorin-proton-wrapper --list-runner
  shorin-proton-wrapper --list-version ge|dw|we

Download only:
  shorin-proton-wrapper --download ge [-d DIR] [--version TAG]
  shorin-proton-wrapper --download dw [-d DIR] [--version TAG]

Install runner:
  shorin-proton-wrapper --install ge [-d DIR] [--version TAG]
  shorin-proton-wrapper --install dw [-d DIR] [--version TAG]
  shorin-proton-wrapper --install-steam ge|dw|we
  shorin-proton-wrapper --install-lutris ge|dw|we

Update runners:
  shorin-proton-wrapper --update
  shorin-proton-wrapper --check-update

Diagnostics:
  shorin-proton-wrapper --doctor

Remove runner:
  shorin-proton-wrapper --remove ge|dw|we
  shorin-proton-wrapper --remove-steam ge|dw|we
  shorin-proton-wrapper --remove-lutris ge|dw|we

Install targets:
  steam   ~/.local/share/Steam/compatibilitytools.d (default)
  local   ~/.local/share/proton/runners (earlier versions; still used and updated)
  lutris  ~/.local/share/lutris/runners/wine

Environment:
  PROTON_PREFIX     prefix path
  PROTON_RUNNER     runner path
  PROTON_LANG       zh|en
EOF
}

